{
  "dom_id": "step-t2907",
  "name": "The Zero Vector is Parallel to Any Vector",
  "problem": "For any vector $\\mathbf{a}$ the vector $0 \\cdot \\mathbf{a}$ is equal to the zero vector: \n\n$$\n0\\cdot\\mathbf{a}=\\mathbf{0}.\n$$\n\nThis means that the zero vector $\\mathbf{0}$ is parallel to *any* vector.",
